# tally 2.2.1, the lead's P39 (L §6.4): a scenario's decision before from is left out like any move: left
# out: mx, as the plan twin prints (review g1 fr_d_20260503 against fr_p_20260503). Before W8: no line.
=== d1_base.tally
model d1b
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input w: date
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = window(2026-04-29, 2026-05-02) "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
ask base: bal(konto, 2026-05-31)
=== fr_d_20260503.tally
scenario sc over d1b
  tally 2
  from 2026-05-03
move mx: transfers
  on w
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount if bal(konto) > 0 PLN then amt else amt
ask e: bal(konto, 2026-04-28), bal(konto, 2026-04-30), bal(konto, 2026-05-01), bal(konto, 2026-05-02), bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc
ask e_p0429: bal(konto, 2026-04-28), bal(konto, 2026-04-30), bal(konto, 2026-05-01), bal(konto, 2026-05-02), bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-04-29
ask e_p0501: bal(konto, 2026-04-28), bal(konto, 2026-04-30), bal(konto, 2026-05-01), bal(konto, 2026-05-02), bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-05-01
ask e_p0502: bal(konto, 2026-04-28), bal(konto, 2026-04-30), bal(konto, 2026-05-01), bal(konto, 2026-05-02), bal(konto, 2026-05-31) in sc with w = 2026-05-02
=== expect e e_p0502
e: (500.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN)
  world: sc
  left out: mx, 1 instances, first 2026-04-29
  cut 2026-06-10
e_p0502: (500.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN, 500.00 PLN)
  pinned: w = 2026-05-02
  world: sc
  left out: mx, 1 instances, first 2026-05-02
  cut 2026-06-10
